272
00:14:27,420 --> 00:14:33,160
In fact, I'm pretty sure it's the enemy base filled with even more people who want to kill us because that's the kind of day it's been.

273
00:14:34,000 --> 00:14:34,860
Well, that's great.

274
00:14:35,860 --> 00:14:39,940
Who the hell thought it'd be a good idea to invite the giant floating boulder to the party?

275
00:14:39,940 --> 00:14:44,180
But look, a pretty little birdie just showed up, too.

276
00:14:47,840 --> 00:14:50,600
No matter what, the castle will not fall.

277
00:14:51,500 --> 00:14:52,840
The royal family.

278
00:14:53,380 --> 00:14:55,200
Welcome home, fancy pants.

279
00:14:56,080 --> 00:14:56,720
Hey!

280
00:14:56,980 --> 00:14:57,400
Noel!

281
00:14:58,120 --> 00:14:59,360
Look who's down there.

282
00:14:59,700 --> 00:15:00,840
It's the captain.

283
00:15:01,320 --> 00:15:03,200
And wait, Fenril, too?

284
00:15:03,420 --> 00:15:05,220
Captain Jack, as well.

285
00:15:05,620 --> 00:15:06,920
Good to see ya!

286
00:15:07,180 --> 00:15:09,200
Sorry to make you worry about me.

287
00:15:09,200 --> 00:15:11,840
I know it must have been lonely for you when I wasn't...

288
00:15:11,840 --> 00:15:14,880
I wouldn't be worried about you if you were missing for a hundred years.

289
00:15:15,060 --> 00:15:16,120
You're so wimpy!

290
00:15:16,340 --> 00:15:20,100
And I hope you enjoyed your nap while the rest of us were trying to save the kingdom.

291
00:15:21,540 --> 00:15:22,020
Idiot.

292
00:15:23,700 --> 00:15:25,640
I'm really glad he pulled through.

293
00:15:26,280 --> 00:15:27,700
Oh, you poor things.

294
00:15:27,980 --> 00:15:30,940
Waiting for beautiful me to make my spectacular return.

295
00:15:31,240 --> 00:15:32,060
Well, don't worry.

296
00:15:32,160 --> 00:15:33,100
The wait is over.

297
00:15:33,700 --> 00:15:34,820
No one missed you.

298
00:15:35,060 --> 00:15:35,980
Now shut up.

299
00:15:36,100 --> 00:15:36,460
Huh.

300
00:15:37,460 --> 00:15:38,300
I know you.

301
00:15:39,200 --> 00:15:42,300
It's been a while, hasn't it, Captain Crazy?

302
00:15:42,960 --> 00:15:44,660
I decided I would join.

303
00:15:44,960 --> 00:15:47,780
Since you seem to be having so much trouble keeping it together.

304
00:15:48,200 --> 00:15:49,800
What was your name again?

305
00:15:51,680 --> 00:15:52,420
Yeah, yeah.

306
00:15:52,480 --> 00:15:53,580
That's real cute.

307
00:15:53,760 --> 00:15:56,380
But like it or not, I'm a member of your ragtag crew.

308
00:15:56,640 --> 00:15:58,200
And you're the one who gave me this cloak.

309
00:15:58,300 --> 00:15:59,360
So get used to it.

310
00:15:59,360 --> 00:16:01,660
There's nobody for you to blame but yourself.

311
00:16:01,880 --> 00:16:03,960
It sure took you long enough, dumbass.

312
00:16:04,360 --> 00:16:05,800
I was getting tired of waiting.

313
00:16:06,680 --> 00:16:08,780
You better make up for wasting time.

314
00:16:09,440 --> 00:16:11,460
And where have you been, Mr. Silver Eagles?

315
00:16:11,580 --> 00:16:13,740
Did you get held up at a hair appointment or something?

316
00:16:14,120 --> 00:16:17,140
Your house is a mess, so you might want to go take care of that.

317
00:16:17,140 --> 00:16:21,860
Get your butts inside or we're going to hog all the carnage for ourselves.

318
00:16:23,860 --> 00:16:26,240
Such nerve from those without royal blood.

319
00:16:26,320 --> 00:16:27,320
Don't mind them.

320
00:16:27,580 --> 00:16:31,160
For what it's worth, you're one of the few people I've always considered to be beautiful.

321
00:16:31,660 --> 00:16:32,120
Silence.

322
00:16:32,280 --> 00:16:33,080
That does not help.

323
00:16:33,620 --> 00:16:36,100
Do whatever you need to do to fix your house.

324
00:16:36,100 --> 00:16:38,600
We're going to go find old King Clover.

325
00:16:39,740 --> 00:16:43,340
They're strong, so don't be a hero and try and take them down on your own.

326
00:16:43,740 --> 00:16:45,720
Your only goal is to rescue and retreat.

327
00:16:46,340 --> 00:16:48,220
Who the hell died and made you, boss?

328
00:16:48,240 --> 00:16:49,080
Oh, shut up.

329
00:16:49,720 --> 00:16:51,800
None of you idiots is allowed to get killed.

330
00:16:52,300 --> 00:16:54,980
You're the last person I needed to hear that from.

331
00:16:58,840 --> 00:16:59,880
I'm home again.

332
00:17:00,500 --> 00:17:03,160
I never thought it would be under these circumstances, though.

333
00:17:06,100 --> 00:17:08,240
So cruel.

334
00:17:08,660 --> 00:17:11,540
How dare those monsters taint our castle with blood.

335
00:17:11,940 --> 00:17:13,480
They will regret this day.

336
00:17:16,120 --> 00:17:21,040
In case you forgot, I don't give a crap about you stuck-up royals and your fancy digs.

337
00:17:21,240 --> 00:17:22,920
So I'm going to do what I want.

338
00:17:24,040 --> 00:17:27,180
Considering how many we're up against, we've got to move smart.

339
00:17:27,800 --> 00:17:28,540
Hey, wait!

340
00:17:28,880 --> 00:17:30,500
Nobody said you could do that!

341
00:17:30,640 --> 00:17:31,600
Just let him go.

342
00:17:32,520 --> 00:17:35,340
He was selected to become one of the royal knights,

343
00:17:35,340 --> 00:17:37,980
so I'm sure he has his own fighting style.

344
00:17:38,680 --> 00:17:39,280
Ready yourself.

345
00:17:41,500 --> 00:17:43,340
There you are, royals!

346
00:17:46,680 --> 00:17:48,500
You ready for your punishment?

347
00:17:48,500 --> 00:17:53,120
I'd ask you the same, but it appears you're incapacitated.

348
00:17:54,160 --> 00:18:00,140
With fine mana control, he can make free transforming mercury magic work for attack and defense at the same time.

349
00:18:00,420 --> 00:18:01,920
Nozel really is talented.

350
00:18:10,560 --> 00:18:11,040
Mother.

351
00:18:11,040 --> 00:18:15,700
We're going to take down the strongest first.

352
00:18:16,700 --> 00:18:17,860
That's Solid's room!

353
00:18:17,860 --> 00:18:28,780
The magic coming off of those compasses is blocking me from landing at it!

354
00:18:29,200 --> 00:18:30,120
What do I do?

355
00:18:30,580 --> 00:18:31,820
This can't be happening!

356
00:18:35,020 --> 00:18:36,540
Water creation magic!

357
00:18:36,900 --> 00:18:38,220
Sea Serpent's Coils!

358
00:18:38,220 --> 00:18:43,520
This is getting me nowhere!

359
00:18:44,220 --> 00:18:45,020
Now what?

360
00:18:45,900 --> 00:18:46,740
Be careful.

361
00:18:47,220 --> 00:18:49,060
We are royalty, you know!

362
00:18:49,440 --> 00:18:50,860
You mentioned that.

363
00:18:51,500 --> 00:18:52,680
Face your fate.

364
00:18:53,560 --> 00:18:54,480
No!

365
00:19:01,560 --> 00:19:03,420
Nozel, it's you!

366
00:19:03,420 --> 00:19:06,080
And Noel!

367
00:19:07,080 --> 00:19:08,040
Mana skin!

368
00:19:08,560 --> 00:19:09,900
Water creation magic!

369
00:19:10,340 --> 00:19:11,660
Sea Dragon's Roar!

370
00:19:13,240 --> 00:19:14,300
I've got her!

371
00:19:14,800 --> 00:19:16,320
Now compass magic!

372
00:19:16,980 --> 00:19:18,060
Willful compass!

373
00:19:20,560 --> 00:19:22,020
She deflected it!

374
00:19:23,400 --> 00:19:27,740
Not even the spell Noel used to defeat me could break through that mana!

375
00:19:27,740 --> 00:19:30,140
I knew you would come.

376
00:19:30,760 --> 00:19:31,680
Thank you, Nozel.

377
00:19:32,760 --> 00:19:33,360
Sincerely.

378
00:19:33,940 --> 00:19:36,980
I can't believe Noel managed a spell like that.

379
00:19:37,520 --> 00:19:39,660
But it still wasn't enough.

380
00:19:41,000 --> 00:19:45,240
I hate to admit it, but in my state I'd only hold them back.

381
00:19:45,760 --> 00:19:47,320
It's better if I just retreat.

382
00:19:49,100 --> 00:19:49,860
Mist magic!

383
00:19:50,480 --> 00:19:52,260
Bewildering Forest of Mist!

384
00:19:53,040 --> 00:19:54,960
All of you will die here.

385
00:19:55,400 --> 00:19:56,260
Compass magic!

386
00:19:56,480 --> 00:19:57,600
Another Atlas!

387
00:20:03,160 --> 00:20:07,320
The only way you're escaping this room alive is if you can defeat me first.

388
00:20:08,760 --> 00:20:09,320
What?

389
00:20:09,940 --> 00:20:11,960
I don't have control of my magic.

390
00:20:12,680 --> 00:20:16,700
This technique forcibly disturbs any and all magic in a given area.

391
00:20:17,160 --> 00:20:20,260
No matter how powerful your own abilities may be, human,

392
00:20:20,620 --> 00:20:23,120
you will never be able to put a scratch on me.

393
00:20:23,500 --> 00:20:24,420
And yet.

394
00:20:26,260 --> 00:20:34,420
My spells will hit you without fail.

395
00:20:35,160 --> 00:20:36,740
Stop her, Nozel!

396
00:20:37,320 --> 00:20:37,820
Please!

397
00:20:38,080 --> 00:20:38,960
Stay there, Solid.

398
00:20:39,660 --> 00:20:41,860
You'd only hold us back as you are now.

399
00:20:42,360 --> 00:20:43,700
I will handle this.

400
00:20:43,700 --> 00:20:46,080
It's okay.

401
00:20:46,760 --> 00:20:47,460
It's okay.

402
00:20:48,240 --> 00:20:49,020
It's okay.

403
00:20:50,600 --> 00:20:52,060
I went through all that training.

404
00:20:52,820 --> 00:20:53,700
I'll succeed.

405
00:20:54,160 --> 00:20:55,320
I can do it.

406
00:20:55,320 --> 00:20:58,500
I won't let you hurt my family anymore!

407
00:21:01,380 --> 00:21:03,300
Let's show her our power, Noel.

408
00:21:04,300 --> 00:21:06,020
The house Silva stands strong.

409
00:21:06,020 --> 00:21:06,560
I won't let you know.

410
00:21:06,620 --> 00:21:07,880
NooFbat thing.

411
00:21:08,460 --> 00:21:09,300
See that.

412
00:21:09,300 --> 00:21:11,300
Oh

413
00:21:39,300 --> 00:22:09,280
See you next time.

414
00:22:09,300 --> 00:22:39,280
See you next time.

415
00:22:39,300 --> 00:22:44,480
Jack the Amazing.

416
00:22:45,900 --> 00:22:47,980
There's nothing that I can't sever.

417
00:22:48,380 --> 00:22:50,000
But are you worth cutting up?

418
00:22:50,180 --> 00:22:51,560
You've got to prove it.

419
00:22:51,820 --> 00:22:55,860
With meat like this, you want to cut it into strips of just the right size.

420
00:22:56,420 --> 00:22:57,100
That's safe.

421
00:22:57,100 --> 00:22:59,040
All right, what's it got next?

422
00:22:59,280 --> 00:23:00,640
Show me your waffet.

423
00:23:00,840 --> 00:23:05,380
The best way to prepare tofu is diced into nice scrumptious little cubes.

424
00:23:05,860 --> 00:23:08,420
Oh, hey, that's how I like my victims too.

425
00:23:08,820 --> 00:23:09,820
Death scythe.

426
00:23:10,180 --> 00:23:11,320
I'm on a roll.

427
00:23:11,520 --> 00:23:13,600
I could carve up stuff all day.

428
00:23:14,020 --> 00:23:18,680
They're supposed to be bite-sized pieces, but I've got a big mouth, so it's tricky.

429
00:23:19,160 --> 00:23:20,060
Death scythe.

430
00:23:20,400 --> 00:23:22,820
Don't let it boil over when you add the miso.

431
00:23:23,380 --> 00:23:23,840
Ta-da!

432
00:23:23,840 --> 00:23:27,760
It's Jack the Ripper's famous pork miso soup.

433
00:23:29,800 --> 00:23:32,300
Oh, no, I forgot to put in the soup.

434
00:23:32,500 --> 00:23:33,180
Stuck!

435
00:23:33,180 --> 00:23:40,880
Once there was a girl called the Steel Warrior Princess, known for dancing gracefully through combat.

436
00:23:41,540 --> 00:23:44,400
Black Clover, page 108, Battlefield Dancer.

437
00:23:44,800 --> 00:23:47,820
Now it is Noelle Silver's turn to dance across the battlefield.

